{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7663455179753654547","title":"采购管培生-2027校招","description":"1、负责与供应商沟通量产项目物料预测和需求、确认需求与落实备料情况；\n2、负责与计划部门对接，及时回复和跟进交货计划、预警交货风险；\n3、订单与交付：根据采购需求和生产计划下达订单，做好交付管理：提前识别物料风险，保证物料按时交付；\n4、供应商管理：协调供应商以确保按计划准时交付，对供应商的交付进行绩效评估，敦促提升供应商的交付能力；\n5、关注市场行情，了解行业行情/供货/产能情况，及早识别和应对供应风险；\n6、管控进料计划，降低库存，协助管控呆滞物料；\n7、协助处理物料品质异常相关事项、供应商对账付款过程中异常事项等。","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历，专业不限，理工类专业（机械、材料、电子）优先；\n2、计划性和逻辑性强，对数据敏感，具有风险意识；\n3、学习能力强，善于分析和解决问题；\n4、诚实守信，严谨细致，责任心强，善于沟通和协调；\n5、具备创新和团队精神，乐观积极、独立担当、系统性思考，敢于打破常规。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1784288286142,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7663455179753474323","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}